# Rex variant of ~/.config/ghostty/themes/vercel-opencode-dark.
# Import with: rex -C CLIENT do client.theme.import path=<this file>
#
# Rex builds its sidebar, panes and raised surfaces by stepping up from the
# background, and none of its built-in dark themes use pure black. This lifts
# the background to #0a0a0a (Vercel's Geist background-100, and the background
# of Rex's Static Noir), and lifts ANSI black above it the same way.
